QuestGuidance.Register("es",102,{
[3233]="70025381\n1\tEncuentra a Suvulch en algún lugar cerca de Lhanuch\tLa última vez que viste a Suvulch fue junto al árbol favorito de Wadu, en una colina cerca de los corrales de bueyes, al oeste de Lhanuch. Nona está enfadada con su padre Suvulch por el cruel trato que le dio a Wadu mientras aún estaba vivo, y quiere que le digas a Suvulch lo que piensa.\n2\tDerrota a dunlendinos hostiles en todo Enedwaith\tSe pueden encontrar dunlendinos hostiles en todo Enedwaith. Suvulch te ha desafiado a una competencia para ver quién puede derrotar a más dunlendinos de clanes enemigos en honor a Wadu.\n3\tHabla con Suvulch\tSuvulch se encuentra cerca del árbol favorito de Wadu, en una colina junto a los corrales de bueyes al oeste de Lhanuch, y se pueden encontrar dunlendinos hostiles en todo Enedwaith. Suvulch te ha desafiado a una competencia para matar a dunlendinos hostiles en memoria de Wadu.\n4\tEncuentra a Radanir en el bosque al este de Lhanuch\tRadanir se encuentra en el campamento de la Compañía Gris, en un bosque al este del pueblo Uch-lûth de Lhanuch. Suvulch te dijo que Radanir te estaba buscando por un asunto urgente.\n5\tLee la carta en la caja cerca de Radanir\tUna segunda carta de Ergothorn se encuentra en la caja cerca de Radanir, en el campamento de la Compañía Gris en el bosque al este de Lhanuch. Radanir ha encontrado una segunda carta de Ergothorn y quiere que la leas y le des tu opinión sobre lo que dice este misterioso corresponsal.\n6\tHabla con Radanir en el bosque al este de Lhanuch\tRadanir se encuentra en el campamento de la Compañía Gris en el bosque al este de Lhanuch. Has leído la segunda carta de Ergothorn, que te llama a la defensa de Zudrugund.\n",
[3234]="7002161E\n1\tEncuentra a Fúni Cortagemas en algún lugar de Minas Elendúr\tFúni Cortagemas está retenido en algún lugar dentro de las profundidades de Minas Elendúr, lejos al este de Echad Eregion. Has aprendido la ubicación de Fúni Cortagemas y ahora deberías intentar rescatarlo.\n",
[3235]="70013AF8\n1\tDerrota a los trasgos a lo largo de las Vetas del Cuerno de Plata (total: 18)\030Recoge Crude Map (total: 4)\tSe pueden encontrar trasgos en las Vetas del Cuerno de Plata, al sur y debajo de la Gran Excavación, y sus mapas se pueden encontrar dentro de Gamil Filik, la mina que han ocupado. Brogur te pidió que mataras trasgos mientras buscas el Corazón de Fuego, y que estuvieras atento a sus mapas; es posible que hayan descubierto la forja y la hayan incluido en sus mapas rudimentarios.\n2\tLleva los mapas rudimentarios a Brogur\tBrogur se encuentra en la Cámara de Mando, subiendo las escaleras del este en la Cámara de la Encrucijada, ubicada en la entrada sur del Camino de Durin, al norte de la Gran Excavación. Has matado a muchos trasgos y recogido sus mapas mientras buscabas el Corazón de Fuego.\n3\tLleva los mapas rudimentarios a Bósi\tBósi se encuentra en la Cámara de la Encrucijada, justo afuera de la Cámara de Mando. Brogur no ha visto nada útil en los mapas rudimentarios de los trasgos que encontraste, pero su primo Bósi podría tener más suerte interpretándolos.\n",
[3236]="70018F0F\n1\tHabla con Bróin\tBróin está descansando en la Senda Pacífica, ubicada en la Sala de Reunión Militar, al este de Sulnul-dûm y al oeste de la Sala de Piedra, en el Camino de Durin. La entrada a la Senda Pacífica está al noreste de Buzun-ghâr. Bróin ha enviado aviso de que desea hablar contigo de nuevo. Orvar te dijo que trataras a Bróin con amabilidad, creyendo que sus pruebas en la guarida acuática del Vigilante y la pérdida de su primo ante las fuerzas de Mazog pueden haberlo afectado profundamente.\n2\tLas Cámaras de Sabiduría, Conocimiento y Reflexión Profunda se encuentran en toda la Gran Excavación, al igual que Katûb-zahar. Cualquiera de estos lugares puede tener los registros mineros que Bróin debía encontrar. Bróin está insatisfecho con las tareas sin sentido que su padre Brogur le ha asignado, y está extremadamente frustrado de que los enanos hagan este tipo de trabajo mientras Bori sigue prisionero de las fuerzas de Mazog.\t\n3\tLleva los registros mineros a Bróin\tBróin está en la Senda Pacífica, ubicada en la Sala de Reunión Militar, al este de Sulnul-dûm y al oeste de la Sala de Piedra, en el Camino de Durin. La entrada a la Senda Pacífica está al noreste de Buzun-ghâr. Has recuperado algunos de los registros mineros que el padre de Bróin quería que encontrara, pero incluyen detalles curiosos que interesarán mucho a Bróin.\n",
[3237]="700143D8\n1\tBori se encuentra con Brogur en la Cámara de Liderazgo, cerca de la Sala Vigesimoprimera, en Zelem-melek. Brogur te ha dicho que su sobrino Bori ha ideado un plan audaz para dar un golpe a los Orcos de la Mano Blanca en Moria, y quiere que le ayudes con sus preparativos.\t\n2\tHabla con Bori\tBori se encuentra en la Cámara de Liderazgo, cerca de la Sala Vigesimoprimera, en Zelem-melek. Has ayudado a Bori a prepararse para su audaz ataque contra la Mano Blanca, y ahora deberías informarle.\n",
[3238]="700143DA\n1\tEncuentra el cruce vigilado en la Carretera Oriental\030Recoge Barrel of Black Powder (total: 8)\tEl cruce vigilado en la Carretera Oriental se encuentra en Nud-melek, y el campamento de la Mano Blanca de Stazgnâkh está ubicado entre las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo. Bori te ha pedido que investigues el cruce vigilado a lo largo de la Carretera Oriental, y que recolectes barriles de pólvora negra del campamento de la Mano Blanca de Stazgnâkh para que te familiarices con él.\n2\tLleva los barriles de pólvora negra a Bori\tBori se encuentra en la Cámara de Liderazgo de la Sala Vigesimoprimera, en Zelem-melek. Has evaluado la fuerza de la fuerza en el cruce vigilado a lo largo de la Carretera Oriental y has encontrado dos entradas a Stazgnâkh, el campamento de la Mano Blanca entre las Vetas del Cuerno Rojo.\n",
[3239]="7005A722\n1\tDecora Vérnozal con alfombras Zhélruka (cantidad: según el diario)\tVérnozal se encuentra en Máttugard, cerca de la Escarpada. Decora Vérnozal con alfombras zhelruka para el príncipe Ingór.\n2\tHabla con el príncipe Ingór\tVérnozal se encuentra en Máttugard, cerca de la Escarpada. El príncipe Ingór desea hablar contigo.\n3\tPlanta cristales en macetas de cristal por todo Vérnozal (total: 12)\tVérnozal se encuentra en Máttugard, cerca de la Escarpada. Coloca los cristales que has recolectado en las macetas de cristal repartidas por Vérnozal.\n4\tHabla con el príncipe Ingór\tVérnozal se encuentra en Máttugard, cerca de la Escarpada. El príncipe Ingór desea hablar contigo.\n",
[3240]="7001AC5A\n1\tHabla con Lenglammel para viajar a Azanarukâr\tLenglammel se encuentra en Gwathrendath, el campamento élfico entre las Fundaciones de Piedra. Lenglammel está esperando para hablar contigo y llevarte a Magor para un asalto a Azanarukâr. NOTA: La inspiración te ayudará si decides emprender este desafío. Esta instancia solo puede ser completada por un grupo de uno o dos jugadores.\n2\tHabla con Lenglammel en Gwathrendath\tLenglammel se encuentra en Gwathrendath, el campamento élfico entre las Fundaciones de Piedra. Has destruido la reliquia de Gorothúl y enviado a Gwathnor y Grawulun sin forma a las profundidades, por un tiempo. Ahora deberías informar a Lenglammel.\n3\tHabla con Haldir en Talan Haldir\tHaldir se encuentra en Talan Haldir, justo fuera de la frontera del Bosque de Oro. Lenglammel te ha enviado a Haldir para transmitirle un mensaje importante: la expedición de la Hueste Dorada debe llevarse a cabo lo antes posible.\n",
[3241]="7001C1F0\n1\tEscóndete detrás de las piedras erguidas en el camino hacia Minas Gîl (total: 3)\tSe pueden encontrar piedras erguidas a lo largo del camino inclinado hacia Minas Gîl, al este de Ost Galadh. Enedhel te ha pedido que te escondas detrás de las piedras erguidas en el camino hacia Minas Gîl para aprender qué tan de cerca los Orcos están vigilando el camino oriental hacia Dol Guldur.\n2\tHabla con Enedhel en Ost Galadh\tEnedhel está en Ost Galadh, en Emyn Lûm. Te has escondido detrás de las piedras erguidas en el camino hacia Minas Gîl, al este de Ost Galadh, y ahora deberías regresar a Enedhel con lo que has aprendido.\n",
[3242]="7001C1F1\n1\tEvalúa la presencia de orcos en Krul Lugu\tKrul Lugu es el nombre orco de un par de fortificaciones orcas en el centro de Taur Morvith, al sur del Santuario Verde. Erymbes te ha pedido que investigues la presencia de orcos en Krul Lugu y que luego busques a su amigo Malendol.\n2\tEncuentra a Malendol dentro o alrededor de Krul Lugu\tMalendol puede estar en algún lugar dentro o alrededor de las fortificaciones orcas de Krul Lugu, en Taur Morvith. Has evaluado la presencia de orcos en Krul Lugu y ahora deberías buscar a Malendol, que podría estar en problemas.\n3\tHabla con Erymbes en el Santuario Verde\tErymbes se encuentra en el Santuario Verde, al norte de los campamentos orcos de Krul Lugu, en Taur Morvith. Has explorado los campamentos orcos de Krul Lugu y defendido a Malendol, y ahora deberías regresar con Erymbes para informarle de lo que has aprendido.\n",
[3243]="7001C1F2\n1\tRecolecta muestras de veneno de las arañas en las Hondonadas Enmarañadas (total: 6)\tSe pueden encontrar arañas en todas las Hondonadas Enmarañadas. Gladiel te ha pedido que recojas veneno de las arañas de las Hondonadas Enmarañadas usando el paño que te dio.\n2\tLleva el paño con las muestras de veneno a Gladiel junto al Santuario del Antiguo\tGladiel está junto al Santuario del Antiguo, en las Hondonadas Enmarañadas. Has recolectado varias muestras de veneno de las arañas de las Hondonadas Enmarañadas y deberías devolverlas a Gladiel para que las examine.\n",
[3244]="7001A97D\n1\tLos Elfos de la Guardia Oculta se encuentran en la bodega de la Posada Embrujada. Bróin te ha pedido que vayas a hablar con los Elfos de la Guardia secreta sobre lo que debe hacerse a continuación.\t\n2\tHabla con Cúcheron en la Posada Embrujada\tCúcheron se encuentra fuera de la Posada Embrujada, ubicada entre los Troncosombríos. Has obtenido las opiniones de los Elfos de la Guardia Oculta sobre qué ruta tomar hacia Dol Guldur y has recibido tres propuestas diferentes.\n3\tAyuda a Enedhel en Ost Galadh, en Emyn Lûm\030Ayuda a Erymbes en Taur Morvith\030Ayuda a Gladiel en las Hondonadas Enmarañadas\tTres exploradores han sido enviados a las Hondonadas Enmarañadas, Emyn Lûm y Taur Morvith. Cúcheron te ha pedido que hables con los Elfos que envió a investigar las áreas a lo largo de las rutas propuestas por la Guardia Oculta. Gladiel está en las Hondonadas Enmarañadas, al oeste del Santuario del Antiguo, cerca de la frontera de Gathbúrz. Erymbes está en Taur Morvith, junto al Santuario Verde, al sur de las Ruinas Salvajes. Enedhel está en Ost Galadh.\n4\tHabla con Cúcheron en la Posada Embrujada\tCúcheron está fuera de la Posada Embrujada, en los Troncosombríos. Has hecho lo que Cúcheron te pidió al reunir información sobre las posibles rutas hacia Dol Guldur y ahora deberías regresar con él.\n5\tHabla con Issuriel en la Posada Embrujada\tIssuriel se encuentra en la bodega de la Posada Embrujada, situada entre los Troncosombríos. Basándose en la información que has proporcionado, Cúcheron ha decidido que la ruta propuesta por Issuriel hacia Dol Guldur tiene la mayor probabilidad de éxito. Quiere que le informes que este es el camino que tomará la Guardia Oculta.\n",
[3245]="70047296\n1\tHabla con Bósi en el Salón bajo la Montaña\tBósi se encuentra en el Salón bajo la Montaña, lamentando la pérdida de su primo y el fracaso de la Guarnición de Hierro.\n2\tHabla con Bósi y acompáñalo a ver al rey Thorin\tBósi se encuentra en el Salón bajo la Montaña, lamentando la pérdida de su primo y el fracaso de la Guarnición de Hierro.\n3\tHabla con el rey Thorin III en su trono en el Salón bajo la Montaña\tThorin III, el Rey bajo la Montaña, se encuentra en su trono en Erebor.\n4\tBusque al sur de Lûghash, en la ladera deL Orodruin, a los héroes enanos desaparecidos\tCon su traición revelada, deberías regresar a Dor Amarth y buscar al sur de Lûghash, cerca de la ladera del Orodruin, para encontrar a los enanos asesinados por Dómor.\n5\tExamina el lugar de enterramiento apresurado\tHas encontrado lo que parece ser un lugar de enterramiento apresurado en Dor Amarth. ¿Fue este el lugar de la traición de Dómor?\n6\tHabla con Laurík cerca de la tumba\tHas encontrado el lugar donde Dómor escondió los cuerpos de los enanos que traicionó y asesinó.\n7\tHabla con el rey Thorin III en su trono en el Salón bajo la Montaña\tThorin III, el Rey bajo la Montaña, se encuentra en su trono en Erebor.\n",
[3246]="70047B61\n1\tHabla con Pippin\tDeberías hablar con Pippin y Merry en Bâr Thorenion para escuchar exactamente lo que piensan sobre Mordor.\n2\tHabla con Merry\tDeberías hablar con Merry en Bâr Thorenion para escuchar sus pensamientos sobre dónde podrían estar los dos semi-Orcos restantes.\n3\tBusca a los semi-Orcos\tPippin y Merry te han pedido que busques a los dos semi-Orcos que huyeron del último encuentro. Merry cree que los encontrarás en algún lugar de Dor Amarth, en el camino hacia Barad-dûr.\n4\tExamina al semi-Orco muerto\tPippin y Merry te han pedido que busques a los dos semi-Orcos que huyeron del último encuentro. Has encontrado a uno de ellos, que ha llegado a un amargo final, en el camino hacia Barad-dûr, y deberías examinar el cadáver.\n5\tPippin y Merry te han pedido que vayas en busca de los dos semi-Orcos que huyeron del último encuentro. Deberías seguir el rastro que lleva desde un semi-Orco, con la esperanza de encontrar al otro.\t\n6\tHabla con el semi-orco\tPippin y Merry te han pedido que busques a los dos semi-Orcos que huyeron del último encuentro. Gracias al cadáver de uno de ellos, has encontrado al otro, que todavía vive. Deberías hablar con él y aprender lo que puedas.\n7\tRegresa a Bâr Thorenion\tRegresa con Merry y Pippin en Bâr Thorenion con noticias de lo que aprendiste del semi-Orco moribundo.\n8\tHabla con Gandalf\tAl regresar a Bâr Thorenion, Gandalf ha aparecido y te ha llamado para hablar con él.\n9\tHabla con Merry\tDeberías hablar con Pippin y Merry en Bâr Thorenion, contándoles al menos parte de la verdad, como te aconsejó Gandalf.\n",
[3247]="700472B1\n1\tHabla con Mithrandir en la sala del trono del rey Elessar\tMithrandir ha llegado a la sala del trono del rey Elessar, en lo alto de Minas Tirith.\n2\tHabla con Mithrandir en la sala del trono y monta guardia\tMithrandir ha llegado a la sala del trono del rey Elessar, en lo alto de Minas Tirith.\n3\tHabla con Mithrandir en la sala del trono del rey Elessar\tMithrandir ha llegado a la sala del trono del rey Elessar, en lo alto de Minas Tirith.\n4\tHabla con el rey Elessar en su sala del trono\tEl rey Elessar se encuentra en su sala del trono, en lo alto de Minas Tirith.\n",
[3248]="70068268\n1\tTalk to Corudan at the amphitheatre\tCorudan is at the amphitheatre outside the city.\n2\tTalk to Daxamat at the amphitheatre\tDaxamat is at the amphitheatre outside the city.\n3\tFind the Hungry Deep Tavern that overlooks the Sail-haven\tThe Hungry Deep Tavern is located up a set of stairs in the Upper Ward, from where it overlooks the Sail-haven.\n4\tPatrons of the Hungry Deep Tavern may have information of use to you.\t\n5\tFind the Whelk and Cockle Tavern to the west, in the Sail-haven\tThe Whelk and Cockle Tavern is located to the west of the Hungry Deep, in the Sail-haven.\n6\tTalk to patrons of the Whelk and Cockle Tavern ([según el diario]/2)\tThe Whelk and Cockle Tavern is not as popular as the last one you visited, but patrons here may still know something.\n7\tWhat has caused this sudden stillness?\tThe folk here seem to be studiously avoiding your gaze.\n8\tTalk to Rothog the Storm outside the Whelk and Cockle Tavern\tRothog the Storm is at the Whelk and Cockle Tavern in the Sail-haven.\n",
[3249]="7004E59A\n1\tFind the home of Authi Gem-cutter in the Dwelling-halls\tThe home of Authi Gem-cutter and his family can be found in the south-western corner of the Dwelling-halls of Erebor.\n2\tTalk to Authi Gem-cutter in the Jewelstead\tAuthi Gem-cutter is in the Jewelstead, the Gem-cutter family home in the Dwelling-halls of Erebor.\n3\tTalk to Mother Amma in the Jewelstead\tMother Amma is in the Jewelstead, the Gem-cutter family home in the Dwelling-halls of Erebor.\n4\tTalk to Authi Gem-cutter in the Jewelstead\tAuthi Gem-cutter is in the Jewelstead, the Gem-cutter family home in the Dwelling-halls of Erebor.\n5\tFind the entrance to the New-lodes of Narathâk east of the entryway within the Lonely Mountain\tThe entrance to the New-lodes of Narathâk is located east of the Dwelling-halls, beyond the passage that runs from the entryway to the Hall Under the Mountain.\n6\tTalk to Gráfar Splitstone in the New-lodes of Narathâk\tAuthi Gem-cutter's brother Gráfar is in the New-lodes of Narathâk.\n7\tDefeat vermin in the New-lodes (total: 8)\tThe New-lodes of Narathâk are crawling with cave-claws and other pests, and Authi's brother Gráfar asked you to help make the mine safe for the miners by thinning out some of the vermin.\n8\tPick up the crate of precious stones by Gráfar Splitstone\tAuthi's brother Gráfar Splitstone has asked you to carry a crate of precious stones back to Mother Amma in the Jewelstead. The Gem-cutter family home is located in the south-west corner of the Dwelling-halls.\n9\tPick up the finely-crafted necklace and deliver it to Erfith on the west side of the Dwelling-halls\tMother Amma has asked you to pick up the finely-crafted necklace and deliver it to Erfith, the customer who requested it. Erfith can be found on the west side of the Dwelling-halls of Erebor, on one of the lower levels.\n10\tTalk to Erfith on the west side of the Dwelling-halls\tErfith the Quarrelsome is on the west side of the Dwelling-halls of Erebor, east of the Jewelstead and down the stairs.\n11\tTalk to Authi Gem-cutter in the Jewelstead\tAuthi Gem-cutter is in the Jewelstead, the Gem-cutter family home in the Dwelling-halls of Erebor.\n",
[3250]="70059A04\n1\tTalk to Durin in Máttugard\tPrince Durin has returned with you to Máttugard.\n2\tFind Bósi at the entrance to the Pit of Stonejaws, north of Máttugard\tDurin ordered Bósi of the Iron Garrison to scout the further reaches of the Mountain-home, and has asked you to meet up with them at the entrance to the Pit of Stonejaws, north of Máttugard.\n3\tTalk to Bósi at the entrance to the Pit of Stonejaws\tBósi is at the entrance to the Pit of Stonejaws.\n4\tDefeat creatures in the Pit of Stonejaws (total: 8)\030Find Bori to the north-west in the Pit of Stonejaws\030Talk to Bori in the Pit of Stonejaws\tBósi's son Bori has gone to search the crypts in the Pit of Stonejaws, and could use your assistance to the north-west.\n5\tBori asked you to search more of the crypts along the westward path, which eventually turns north and slopes upward.\t\n6\tBori has agreed to meet you by the upper crypts, further north in the Pit of Stonejaws.\t\n",
[3251]="7004E634\n1\tFind Khîl outside the entrance to the Lonely Mountain\tKhîl might be found outside the entrance to the Lonely Mountain.\n2\tTalk to Khîl outside the Lonely Mountain\tKhîl the Tale-spinner is outside the entrance to Erebor, regaling onlookers with his stories.\n3\tDemonstrate to Khîl that you are ready to listen to his tales\tKhîl the Tale-spinner is outside the entrance to Erebor, regaling onlookers with his stories.\n4\tTalk to Khîl and hear his tale\tKhîl the Tale-spinner is outside the entrance to Erebor, regaling onlookers with his stories.\n5\tUsa agree\030Usa ahem\030Usa angry\030Usa confused\030Usa grumble\030Usa no\030Usa yes\tKhîl the Tale-spinner is outside the entrance to Erebor, regaling onlookers with his stories.\n6\tTalk to Khîl and hear his tale\tKhîl the Tale-spinner is outside the entrance to Erebor, regaling onlookers with his stories.\n7\tUsa agree\030Usa yes\030Usa ahem\030Usa angry\030Valves and pipes? No one else has mentioned such a machine at the battle\030Usa grumble\030Usa no\tKhîl the Tale-spinner is outside the entrance to Erebor, regaling onlookers with his stories.\n8\tTalk to Khîl and hear his tale\tKhîl the Tale-spinner is outside the entrance to Erebor, regaling onlookers with his stories.\n9\tUsa agree\030Usa yes\030Usa ahem\030Usa angry\030Usa confused\030Usa grumble\030Usa no\tKhîl the Tale-spinner is outside the entrance to Erebor, regaling onlookers with his stories.\n10\tTalk to Khîl and hear his tale\tKhîl the Tale-spinner is outside the entrance to Erebor, regaling onlookers with his stories.\n11\tTalk to Authi Gem-cutter in the Jewelstead\tAuthi Gem-cutter is in the Jewelstead, the Gem-cutter family home in the Dwelling-halls of Erebor.\n",
[3252]="7006826A\n1\tTalk to Hármelak in her manor\tHármelak is in the main hall of her manor.\n2\tFind the courtyard in Hármelak's manor\tHármelak asked you to wait for her in the courtyard of her manor.\n3\tWait for Hármelak in the courtyard of her manor\tHármelak asked you to wait for her in the courtyard of her manor.\n4\tTalk to Hármelak by the courtyard\tHármelak has arrived in the courtyard.\n5\tFind the garden of Hármelak's manor\tHármelak asked you to wait for her in the garden to the north of the courtyard.\n6\tWait for Hármelak in the garden to the north\tHármelak asked you to wait for her in the garden to the north.\n7\tTalk to Hármelak in the garden of her manor\tHármelak has arrived in the garden of her manor.\n8\tFind the office to the north in Hármelak's manor\tHármelak asked you to wait for her in the office to the north.\n9\tWait for Hármelak in the office to the north\tHármelak asked you to wait for her in the office to the north.\n10\tTalk to Hármelak in the office of her manor\tHármelak has arrived in her office.\n",
[3253]="70059A05\n1\tLook out over the Pit of Stonejaws\tBori has asked you to look out over the Pit of Stonejaws, which contains the crypts of the many dwarf-families that were laid to rest over the years.\n2\tTalk to Bori by the upper crypts in the Pit of Stonejaws\tBori is by the upper crypts in the Pit of Stonejaws.\n3\tClear rubble from the entrance to the south-west\tBori needs your help to clear the rubble and debris away from the entrance to the south-west.\n4\tClear rubble from the entrance to the south-west\tBori needs your help to clear the rubble and debris away from the entrance.\n5\tClear rubble from the entrance to the south-west\tBori needs your help to clear the rubble and debris away from the entrance.\n6\tExplore the room you have unearthed from the rubble\tTogether, you and Bori have cleared the rubble away from the room to the south-west, and can now gain entrance.\n7\tExamine the broken mosaic in Zul-mazal\tA broken mosaic decorates one wall of this chamber.\n8\tTalk to Bori in Zul-mazal\tBori is in Zul-mazal.\n9\tFind Bósi outside Shakhajât in the centre of the Pit of Stonejaws\tBósi is outside the fortress of Shakhajât in the centre of the Pit of Stonejaws.\n10\tTalk to Bósi outside Shakhajât in the centre of the Pit of Stonejaws\tBósi is outside Shakhajât in the centre of the Pit of Stonejaws.\n",
[3254]="70068269\n1\tTalk to Rothog the Storm outside Hármelak's manor\tRothog the Storm has escorted you from Hármelak's manor. He clearly believes his task is finished.\n2\tFind Azagath's water-carriers on a dock near the Harbour Warden's tower\tHármelak told you that every day Azagath's servants can be found on the docks by the Harbour Warden's tower, filling bowls with water to carry to the Citadel of Winds.\n3\tTalk to water-bearer Enât on the dock\tAzagath's water-bearers are on a dock by the Harbour Warden's tower.\n4\tTalk to water-bearer Ushu on the dock\tAzagath's water-bearers are on a dock by the Harbour Warden's tower.\n5\tPick up the bowl of water on the dock\tThe water-bearers will only allow you to accompany them into the Citadel if you can prove up to their task.\n6\tTalk to Ushu on the dock beside the Harbour Warden's tower\tAzagath's water-bearers are on the dock beside the Harbour Warden's tower.\n",
[3255]="7004E637\n1\tTalk to Authi Gem-cutter in the Jewelstead and go with him to petition the king\tAuthi Gem-cutter is in the Jewelstead, the Gem-cutter family home in the Dwelling-halls of Erebor.\n2\tTalk to Authi Gem-cutter in the Jewelstead\tAuthi Gem-cutter is in the Jewelstead, the Gem-cutter family home in the Dwelling-halls of Erebor.\n",
[3256]="70059A07\n1\tTalk to Imák outside Shakhajât\030Talk to Bróin outside Shakhajât\tBósi has asked Imák and Bróin to draw the defenders of Shakhajât out into the open.\n2\tTalk to Bósi outside Shakhajât\tBósi is outside Shakhajât. Given Bróin's discomfort with the plan, perhaps you should volunteer in his stead?\n3\tBósi has agreed that you can carry out Bróin's part of the plan: climbing either the left or right slope around the fortress and using a discarded horn of battle to draw forth some of the hobgoblins from Shakhajât.\t\n4\tMeet up with Bróin inside Shakhajât\tNow that you have carried out your part of the plan, you should join the dwarves inside Shakhajât.\n5\tTalk to Bróin inside Shakhajât\tBróin is inside Shakhajât and desires to speak with you.\n6\tTalk to the dwarf-woman Bróin saw within Shakhajât\030Defeat hobgoblins in the Pit of Stonejaws (total: 8)\tBróin has seen a dwarf-woman fighting in the fortress and wants you to check on her while you combat the forces inside Shakhajât.\n7\tTalk to Fastrith outside Shakhajât\tThe dwarves have made their presence known to Bósi's satisfaction and are now ready to meet up outside Shakhajât.\n8\tTalk to Bori outside Shakhajât\tBori is waiting to meet up with you outside Shakhajât.\n",
[3257]="70059A08\n1\tTalk to Fastrith outside Shakhajât\tFastrith Halcomida se encuentra a las afueras de Shakhajât.\n2\tTalk to Fastrith and travel with her to Zul-mazal\tFastrith is outside Shakhajât, waiting for you and Bori to bring her to Zul-mazal to examine the interesting mosaic.\n3\tTalk to Imák in Zul-mazal\tImák is standing in Zul-mazal, waiting to speak with you.\n",
[3258]="70068272\n1\tTalk to water-bearer Ushu on the dock beside the Harbour Warden's tower and accompany her to the Citadel of Winds\tWater-bearer Ushu is on the dock beside the Harbour Warden's tower, waiting to accompany you to the Citadel of Winds.\n2\tTalk to Thorongil by the Harbour Warden's tower\tYou have rescued Thorongil from the Kindred of the Coins... with a little help.\n3\tWait for the others to arrive\tYou have rescued Thorongil from the Kindred of the Coins... with a little help.\n4\tTalk to Nauriel by the Harbour Warden's tower\tNauriel is relieved to see that you have rescued her son from the Kindred of the Coins.\n",
[3259]="7004E638\n1\tGandalf is in the Wizard-home, east of the Jewelstead and up several stairs\tGandalf is in the room that was given to him in the Dwelling-halls, east of the Jewelstead and up several sets of stairs.\n2\tMeet up with Authi and Khîl outside the entrance to the Lonely Mountain\tAuthi planned to meet you outside the entrance to the Lonely Mountain after you prepared for the journey and said good-bye to Gandalf.\n3\tTalk to Khîl outside the Lonely Mountain\tKhîl Tale-spinner is at the entrance to the Lonely Mountain.\n4\tTalk to Authi outside the Lonely Mountain\tAuthi Gem-cutter is at the entrance to the Lonely Mountain.\n5\tVisit Méthur, a friend of the Gem-cutters who lives in Hammerstead\030Find an entrance to the town of Utterby\030Defeat insects throughout the Ironfold (total: 10)\030Defeat beasts throughout the Ironfold (total: 12)\030Defeat Easterlings throughout the Ironfold (total: 14)\030Visit Arin, a friend of the Gem-cutters who lives in Járnfast but is likely fishing in the Redwater\030Look from the cliff's edge at Skald's Drop to survey the lands below\tAuthi has suggested you help the people of the Ironfold as you travel to Járnfast. Complete any four of the objectives Authi has suggested as you travel through the Ironfold to Járnfast.\n6\tTravel to the entrance of Járnfast, in the Ironfold\tThe entrance to Járnfast is in the north-east corner of the Ironfold.\n7\tTalk to Khîl at the entrance to Járnfast\tYou have successfully escorted Khîl to Járnfast and should now speak to him.\n8\tTalk to Authi at the entrance to Járnfast\tAuthi is at the entrance to Járnfast.\n",
[3260]="7004E639\n1\tFind Náin the Slakeless, Lord of the Ironfort, at his throne\tNáin the Slakeless, Lord of the Ironfort, can be found at his throne atop the northern ramps.\n2\tTalk to Náin the Slakeless in Járnfast\tNáin the Slakeless, Lord of the Ironfort, can be found at his throne atop the northern ramps.\n3\tFind Durin in the Quenching Trough opposite the entrance to Járnfast\tThe Quenching Trough is a low-ceilinged tavern opposite the entrance to Járnfast.\n4\tTalk to Durin in the Quenching Trough\tDurin is in the Quenching Trough, a low-ceiling tavern opposite the entrance to Járnfast.\n5\tTalk to Durin (again) in the Quenching Trough\tDurin is in the Quenching Trough, a low-ceilinged tavern opposite the entrance to Járnfast.\n6\tTalk to Náin the Slakeless in Járnfast\tNáin the Slakeless, Lord of the Ironfort, can be found at his throne atop the northern ramps.\n",
[3261]="70068271\n1\tTalk to Jajax by the Harbour Warden's tower\tJajax is by the Harbour Warden's tower.\n2\tTalk to Nimrodel by the Harbour Warden's tower\tNimrodel is by the Harbour Warden's tower.\n3\tThe successful completion of your mission to Umbar is the result of those who helped you, and many of them are now by the Harbour Warden's tower and want to speak with you.\t\n4\tTalk to Caebar by the Harbour Warden's tower\tCaebar is by the Harbour Warden's tower, a long way from his home.\n",
[3262]="70059A0A\n1\tTalk to Fastrith in Zul-mazal\030Talk to Bróin in Zul-mazal\tImák has asked if Fastrith and Bróin wish to investigate the dealings of the Angmarim cultists in Câr Bronach.\n2\tMeet up with Imák at the Witch-gate between the Pit of Stonejaws and Câr Bronach\tImák has suggested that you meet up at the Witch-gate, which can be found at the connexion between the Pit of Stonejaws and Câr Bronach.\n3\tTalk to Imák at the Witch-gate\tImák stands at the Witch-gate between the Pit of Stonejaws and Câr Bronach.\n",
[3263]="7004E63C\n1\tTalk to Durin in Járnfast\tDurin is at his uncle's throne in Járnfast.\n2\tMeet up with Durin east of Utterby, in the Ironfold\tDurin is east of Utterby, in the Ironfold.\n3\tTalk to Durin east of Utterby\tDurin is east of Utterby, in the Ironfold.\n4\tBiraisbij tharâkh: Jangovar tents on the eastern side of Utterby\030Biraisbij tharâkh: Jangovar tents on the southern side of Utterby\030Bini'zig utrâd (total: 4)\tDurin suggested using dwarf-phrases that will be unfamiliar to the Jangovar in order to confuse your foes and to attain strategic advantage when you move against them: Biraisbêj tharâkh, \"scouting the approaches.\" Bini'zêg utrâd, \"blinding the watchers.\" Mahinsês mamahkhafdân, \"rescuing the prisoners.\" Isgêr narakakâ, \"defeating the reinforcements.\" Ensêkh, \"setting a trap.\"\n5\tInteractúa con Prisoner of the Jangovar\tDurin suggested using dwarf-phrases that will be unfamiliar to the Jangovar in order to confuse your foes and to attain strategic advantage when you move against them: Biraisbêj tharâkh, \"scouting the approaches.\" Bini'zêg utrâd, \"blinding the watchers.\" Mahinsês mamahkhafdân, \"rescuing the prisoners.\" Isgêr narakakâ, \"defeating the reinforcements.\" Ensêkh, \"setting a trap.\"\n6\tIsgir narakakâ (total: 4)\030Ensikh to waylay the Jangovar at the cliff-face near Skald's Drop (total: 2)\tDurin suggested using dwarf-phrases that will be unfamiliar to the Jangovar in order to confuse your foes and to attain strategic advantage when you move against them: Biraisbêj tharâkh, \"scouting the approaches.\" Bini'zêg utrâd, \"blinding the watchers.\" Mahinsês mamahkhafdân, \"rescuing the prisoners.\" Isgêr narakakâ, \"defeating the reinforcements.\" Ensêkh, \"setting a trap.\"\n7\tTalk to Durin at Skald's Drop\tDurin is beneath the rising cliff-face at Skald's Drop.\n8\tTalk to Náin the Slakeless in Járnfast\tNáin the Slakeless, Lord of the Ironfort, can be found at his throne atop the ramps.\n9\tTalk to Durin in Járnfast\tDurin can be found by his uncle's throne in Járnfast.\n",
[3264]="70059A11\n1\tScout the Iron Pass in the north-western reaches of Câr Bronach\030Talk to Imák at the Iron Pass\030Defeat beasts in Câr Bronach (total: 4)\tThe Iron Pass is located in the north-western reaches of Câr Bronach, and Imák wants you to make the road there as safe as you can while investigating the enemy presence on that route to Angmar.\n2\tScout the Narrow Way between Câr Bronach and Elderslade\030Defeat beasts in Câr Bronach (total: 4)\tHaving scouted the Iron Pass, Imák thinks you should now do the same for the Narrow Way, the southern pass into Elderslade. He also wants you to continue your efforts to make the mountain paths safe for the Gabil'akkâ.\n3\tTalk to Imák at the Narrow Way\tYou have met up with Imák at the Narrow Way only to discover that a former companion also shows an interest in the situation at Câr Bronach.\n4\tTalk to Venko at the Narrow Way\tYour former companion Venko has also come to investigate the Narrow Way between Câr Bronach and Elderslade.\n5\tRead the crumpled parchment given to you by Venko\tVenko gave you a crumpled piece of parchment that he wrestled from one of the Angmarim, and is waiting for you to read it.\n6\tGive the crumpled parchment to Imák at the Narrow Way\tVenko has asked you to show the crumpled parchment to Imák.\n7\tTalk to Venko at the Narrow Way\tVenko is waiting to hear your thoughts at the Narrow Way between Câr Bronach and Elderslade.\n",
})
